d the events you choose \\n\\n\\n\\n\\nStar  [ 0  ](/root/risingwave/-/starrers \"Starrers\")\\n\\n[ Fork  ](/root/risingwave/-/forks/new \"Create new fork\") [ 0  ](/root/risingwave/-/forks)\\n\\nProject ID: 12 \\n\\nMore actions \\n\\n  * Copy project ID: 12 \\n  * [ Project settings  ](/root/risingwave/edit)\\n\\n\\n\\n##  Project information \\n\\nBest-in-class stream processing, analytics, and management. Perform continuous analytics, or build event-driven applications, real-time ETL pipelines, and feature stores in minutes. Unified streaming and batch. PostgreSQL compatible. \\n\\nRust  91.4%  \">\\n\\nJava  3.8%  \">\\n\\nPython  2.3%  \">\\n\\nShell  1.1%  \">\\n\\nTSX  0.5%  \">\\n\\n  * [ **11,621** Commits ](/root/risingwave/-/commits/main)\\n  * [ **1,416** Branches ](/root/risingwave/-/branches)\\n  * [ **79** Tags ](/root/risingwave/-/tags)\\n  * [ **314 MiB** Project Storage ](/root/risingwave/-/usage_quotas)\\n  * [ **63** Releases ](/root/risingwave/-/releases)\\n\\n\\n\\n  * [ README ](/root/risingwave/-/blob/main/README.md)\\n  * [ Apache License 2.0  ](/root/risingwave/-/blob/main/LICENSE)\\n  * [ CONTRIBUTING ](/root/risingwave/-/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\\n  * [ Auto DevOps enabled ](/root/risingwave/-/settings/ci_cd#autodevops-settings)\\n  * [ Add CHANGELOG ](/root/risingwave/-/new/main?commit_message=Add+CHANGELOG&file_name=CHANGELOG)\\n  * [ Add Kubernetes cluster  ](/root/risingwave/-/clusters)\\n  * [ Add Wiki ](/root/risingwave/-/wikis/home?view=create)\\n  * [ Configure Integrations  ](/root/risingwave/-/settings/integrations)\\n\\n\\n\\nCreated on \\n\\nNovember 19, 2024 \\n\\n<::after>\\n\\nmain \\n\\nSelect Git revision \\n\\n  * Branches  20 \\n  * patch/oya-2.0.1 \\n  * siyuan/fix-pg-citext \\n  * kwannoel/my-sql-tvf \\n  * main  default  protected \\n  * dependabot/cargo/simd-json-0.14.2 \\n  * dylan/support_s3_path_style_access_for_source \\n  * kwannoel/ch1 \\n  * release-2.1 \\n  * siyuan/mysql-multi-db \\n  * release-2.0 \\n 